cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "HerbFold: identity-aware linkage of medicinal-plant chemistry, predicted structures and assay evidence"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/masterj7874/HerbFold"
abstract: >-
  HerbFold links canonical molecular identity, protein-target sequence, selected
  AlphaFold 3 coordinate artifacts, quantum descriptor acquisition records and
  assay-specific evidence, while keeping observation status and prediction
  status separate. It reports why a numerical value is present or withheld
  instead of substituting one scientific quantity for another.
keywords:
  - cheminformatics
  - medicinal plants
  - molecular identity
  - data provenance
  - evidence integration
  - research software
  - AlphaFold 3
  - assay applicability
